{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b\u3053\u306e\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30b9\u30c8\u30a2\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306f\u304a\u4f7f\u3044\u306eSteam\u8a00\u8a9e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u82f1\u8a9e\u3067\u8868\u793a\u3055\u308c\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8aac\u660e\u3092\u3054\u89a7\u306b\u306a\u308b\u306b\u306f\u3001Steam\u30af\u30e9\u30a4\u30a2\u30f3\u30c8\u306e\u8a00\u8a9e\u3092\u300c\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u300d\u306b\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a command-based RPG set in the Warring States period, one of the most fascinating eras in Japanese history. Enjoy various elements that capture the atmosphere of the Warring States period.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfVarious factions from across the country appear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/2709e77ff1d259d97e150983fe9ac8be.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite daimyo from over 85 factions and aim to unify the country. The difficulty varies depending on the abilities of the daimyo and vassals, the number of vassals, and the surrounding environment, so you can play repeatedly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfOver 300 unique generals appear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/0ec3c067a64a69a21af5224fb41f00a0.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous generals who adorned the Warring States period appear in the game. Over 300 in total!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generals who are not affiliated with any faction may join your ranks after defeating them in battle. Even generals affiliated with other factions may join your ranks after you conquer their faction. Gather as many talented vassals as possible and aim for unification!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfForm your own army with your favorite generals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/fb0e434b0c18d13242c71cb489df73dc.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can form units at your faction's castle. You can also assign deputy commanders to generals in your units to enhance their abilities. Combine generals with various skills and abilities to form the strongest unit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfTrain the strongest unit and enhance generals through equipment treasure hunting!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/5aea98f24c6f13e0df3456fe893c0cfc.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle scenes, use attribute skills such as spear, cavalry, archery, and strategy, as well as powerful unique skills to overwhelm enemy units. Enemy levels become stronger the farther you are from your base. However, there are no penalties for being defeated, so keep trying (except for some event battles).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/a5b201f309c06b1d9fde0025d3b271f3.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, equipment can be obtained from enemy drops or certain events. Items are randomly assigned \u201cquality\u201d and \u201ctitles,\u201d so enjoy treasure hunting for divine equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfConquer enemy castles in any order</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/29480414ff63dc4f6504bd6d5efb3ff5.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vast field map, based on an actual map of Japan, features enemy castles scattered across the landscape. Whether you choose to \u201cstart by defeating weaker forces to build your strength\u201d or \u201ctake down that famous warlord first to obtain their equipment,\u201d conquer enemy castles in any order you like and aim for national unification.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfVarious events based on progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/f4366c75d0a55d4b6c4bbb4cd792a067.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your progress in conquering enemy forces, various events\u2014both good and bad\u2014will occur. Overcome them all and aim for national unification!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891910?t=1768953886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891910?t=1768953886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/f9500caa88ddec012b71bb2bed643e1ac8205a36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768953886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/f9500caa88ddec012b71bb2bed643e1ac8205a36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768953886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4031630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b\u3053\u306e\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30b9\u30c8\u30a2\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306f\u304a\u4f7f\u3044\u306eSteam\u8a00\u8a9e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u82f1\u8a9e\u3067\u8868\u793a\u3055\u308c\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8aac\u660e\u3092\u3054\u89a7\u306b\u306a\u308b\u306b\u306f\u3001Steam\u30af\u30e9\u30a4\u30a2\u30f3\u30c8\u306e\u8a00\u8a9e\u3092\u300c\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u300d\u306b\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a command-based RPG set in the Warring States period, one of the most fascinating eras in Japanese history. Enjoy various elements that capture the atmosphere of the Warring States period.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfVarious factions from across the country appear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/2709e77ff1d259d97e150983fe9ac8be.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite daimyo from over 85 factions and aim to unify the country. The difficulty varies depending on the abilities of the daimyo and vassals, the number of vassals, and the surrounding environment, so you can play repeatedly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfOver 300 unique generals appear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/0ec3c067a64a69a21af5224fb41f00a0.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous generals who adorned the Warring States period appear in the game. Over 300 in total!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generals who are not affiliated with any faction may join your ranks after defeating them in battle. Even generals affiliated with other factions may join your ranks after you conquer their faction. Gather as many talented vassals as possible and aim for unification!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfForm your own army with your favorite generals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/fb0e434b0c18d13242c71cb489df73dc.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can form units at your faction's castle. You can also assign deputy commanders to generals in your units to enhance their abilities. Combine generals with various skills and abilities to form the strongest unit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfTrain the strongest unit and enhance generals through equipment treasure hunting!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/5aea98f24c6f13e0df3456fe893c0cfc.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle scenes, use attribute skills such as spear, cavalry, archery, and strategy, as well as powerful unique skills to overwhelm enemy units. Enemy levels become stronger the farther you are from your base. However, there are no penalties for being defeated, so keep trying (except for some event battles).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/a5b201f309c06b1d9fde0025d3b271f3.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, equipment can be obtained from enemy drops or certain events. Items are randomly assigned \u201cquality\u201d and \u201ctitles,\u201d so enjoy treasure hunting for divine equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfConquer enemy castles in any order</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/29480414ff63dc4f6504bd6d5efb3ff5.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vast field map, based on an actual map of Japan, features enemy castles scattered across the landscape. Whether you choose to \u201cstart by defeating weaker forces to build your strength\u201d or \u201ctake down that famous warlord first to obtain their equipment,\u201d conquer enemy castles in any order you like and aim for national unification.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfVarious events based on progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/f4366c75d0a55d4b6c4bbb4cd792a067.avif?t=1768953886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your progress in conquering enemy forces, various events\u2014both good and bad\u2014will occur. Overcome them all and aim for national unification!</p>","developers":["hizaniya games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/863585ed64bea4402d9c4670e9b13cc53ad7671e/header.jpg?t=1768953886","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891910/1701611399/988490b57493a188051b7020e3bdae241123a9ad/1760336897/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760337583","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891910/1701611399/988490b57493a188051b7020e3bdae241123a9ad/1760336897/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760337583","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891910/1701611399/988490b57493a188051b7020e3bdae241123a9ad/1760336897/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760337583","id":257216757,"name":"Samurai Heroes Trailer2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216757/63d7c70877ce6731c289038c30d0deef6c813589/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760337583"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891910/1395549541/b70cf2d83100927aa53f760efbef0709d1757ba7/1760199986/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760201335","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891910/1395549541/b70cf2d83100927aa53f760efbef0709d1757ba7/1760199986/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760201335","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891910/1395549541/b70cf2d83100927aa53f760efbef0709d1757ba7/1760199986/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760201335","id":257216131,"name":"\u6226\u56fd\u82f1\u96c4\u8b5a \u6700\u65b0\u4e88\u544a\u7de8","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216131/8d2d26d571dc5a831346e6abe641dc8c15111170/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760201335"}],"name":"\u6226\u56fd\u82f1\u96c4\u8b5a-Samurai Heroes-","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (or bet