68953886"}],"short_description":"This is a highly flexible command RPG set in Japan's Warring States period. There are over 85 playable factions and over 300 generals! All items have random titles and qualities! Enjoy collecting generals and items, and freely forming your troops!","steam_appid":3891910,"support_info":{"email":"dai.yuasa@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}